# Create a graph
CreateGraph graph1

# Add nodes to the graph
AddNode graph1 n1
AddNode graph1 n2
AddNode graph1 n3

# Add edges to the graph
AddEdge graph1 n1 n2 e1
AddEdge graph1 n2 n3 e2
AddEdge graph1 n3 n1 e3

# Print the nodes in the graph
ListNodes graph1

# Print the edges in the graph
ListChildren graph1 n1
ListChildren graph1 n2
ListChildren graph1 n3